						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														It is not going to be permant, but some of you know I was in a war btw man and machine.  Lets just say the machine kicked my ass, because my computer is being a bitch and make playing EQ like watching a movie in slow motion or worse.  With this much lag I cannot play my characters correctly and let some of people die, not you guys but some others in the overthere.  So I have gotten the white flag out and waving it high, the computer one. So for me being a broke college student its going to take a while to solve this problem.  So keep your chins up and when I come back I want the guild to be strong and just be there.  So this is SanaDeb aka Dragflyer signing off for a while, going to explore the thing called RL.  Sisters leave a light on for me, so I can find the way back home. Brother keep up the work, also please tell Caracan about me and my situation, also tell it to wizzil if he comes back.  Well Said my peace, Catch you all on the flip side.<br />
<br />
The Dogmarta corporation is shutting its doors and I am outta here **Sana bows and heads out to the darkness of the unknown**						</td>
